[
{
"start": 16.14,
"end": 20.4,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Notion replaces the dozen tools your team is currently using, half the time.",
"char_start": 16,
"char_end": 92,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s02"
},
{
"start": 20.46,
"end": 22.56,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Try notion.com today.",
"char_start": 93,
"char_end": 114,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s03"
},
{
"start": 22.56,
"end": 31.92,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Before we get into the details \u2013 \u00c9lodie Chevalier was on the previous episode and said that tire pressure is more important than suspension settings.",
"char_start": 115,
"char_end": 264,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s04"
},
{
"start": 31.92,
"end": 32.88,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "Yes, exactly.",
"char_start": 282,
"char_end": 295,
"unit_id": "t0003.u01",
"sent_id": "t0003.s01"
},
{
"start": 32.94,
"end": 35.46,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "And that ties in with what we're discussing today.",
"char_start": 296,
"char_end": 346,
"unit_id": "t0003.u01",
"sent_id": "t0003.s02"
},
{
"start": 35.46,
"end": 41.7,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "I want to point something out \u2013 \u00c9lodie Chevalier mentioned this same dynamic a few episodes ago.",
"char_start": 363,
"char_end": 459,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s01"
},
{
"start": 41.7,
"end": 47.82,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "I want to point something out \u2013 Julien Mercier mentioned this same dynamic a few episodes ago.",
"char_start": 460,
"char_end": 554,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s02"
},
{
"start": 210.0,
"end": 211.14,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "I want to explore this further.",
"char_start": 555,
"char_end": 586,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s03"
},
{
"start": 211.2,
"end": 214.62,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "What did you believe about this topic, and what have you revised your views on?",
"char_start": 587,
"char_end": 666,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s04"
},
{
"start": 214.62,
"end": 223.2,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "It boils down to this: most mysterious creaking noises are resolved by cleaning the contact surfaces and tightening the bolts to the specified torque.",
"char_start": 684,
"char_end": 834,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s01"
},
{
"start": 223.26,
"end": 226.62,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use Spoke & Wrench.",
"char_start": 835,
"char_end": 884,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s02"
},
{
"start": 226.68,
"end": 230.34,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "The framing is important because it tells you what compromises you're making.",
"char_start": 885,
"char_end": 962,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s03"
},
{
"start": 230.34,
"end": 231.72,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "This is a useful perspective.",
"char_start": 979,
"char_end": 1008,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s01"
},
{
"start": 231.78,
"end": 235.38,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Where do the fields of human resources and transmission mechanics intersect?",
"char_start": 1009,
"char_end": 1085,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s02"
},
{
"start": 235.38,
"end": 236.88,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 1103,
"char_end": 1123,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s01"
},
{
"start": 236.94,
"end": 242.52,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "A bicycle should feel quiet and predictable so that your attention remains focused on the trail.",
"char_start": 1124,
"char_end": 1220,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s02"
},
{
"start": 242.58,
"end": 246.9,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "And the secondary effect is the part that almost everyone misses.",
"char_start": 1221,
"char_end": 1286,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s03"
},
{
"start": 246.9,
"end": 248.04,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "I want to explore this further.",
"char_start": 1303,
"char_end": 1334,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s01"
},
{
"start": 248.1,
"end": 252.72,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "What is the structural aspect that most listeners don't have access to?",
"char_start": 1335,
"char_end": 1406,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s02"
},
{
"start": 252.72,
"end": 253.26,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "Of course.",
"char_start": 1424,
"char_end": 1434,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s01"
},
{
"start": 253.32,
"end": 259.32,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "The wear and tear on the chain is the best indicator of when you'll need to replace the cassette.",
"char_start": 1435,
"char_end": 1532,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s02"
},
{
"start": 259.38,
"end": 262.74,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use Spoke & Wrench.",
"char_start": 1533,
"char_end": 1582,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s03"
},
{
"start": 262.8,
"end": 266.46,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "The frame geometry matters because it tells you what compromises you're making.",
"char_start": 1583,
"char_end": 1662,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s04"
},
{
"start": 266.46,
"end": 267.96,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Tell me more.",
"char_start": 1679,
"char_end": 1692,
"unit_id": "t0010.u01",
"sent_id": "t0010.s01"
},
{
"start": 267.96,
"end": 271.92,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "Spoke & Wrench is one of the platforms where this is clearly evident.",
"char_start": 1710,
"char_end": 1779,
"unit_id": "t0011.u01",
"sent_id": "t0011.s01"
},
{
"start": 271.98,
"end": 275.58,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 1780,
"char_end": 1842,
"unit_id": "t0011.u01",
"sent_id": "t0011.s02"
},
{
"start": 275.58,
"end": 277.56,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Tell me how you came to that decision.",
"char_start": 1859,
"char_end": 1897,
"unit_id": "t0012.u01",
"sent_id": "t0012.s01"
},
{
"start": 277.62,
"end": 280.26,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "How does RockShox fit into this picture?",
"char_start": 1898,
"char_end": 1938,
"unit_id": "t0012.u01",
"sent_id": "t0012.s02"
},
{
"start": 280.26,
"end": 280.8,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "Of course.",
"char_start": 1956,
"char_end": 1966,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s01"
},
{
"start": 280.86,
"end": 285.9,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "The maintenance intervals for the suspension are a risk management decision.",
"char_start": 1967,
"char_end": 2043,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s02"
},
{
"start": 285.96,
"end": 290.34,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "If you ignore that, you'll end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
"char_start": 2044,
"char_end": 2133,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s03"
},
{
"start": 290.34,
"end": 291.18,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "You know what?",
"char_start": 2150,
"char_end": 2164,
"unit_id": "t0014.u01",
"sent_id": "t0014.s01"
},
{
"start": 291.24,
"end": 295.92,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "I'll be frank: Linear powers all of my engineering work on a daily basis.",
"char_start": 2165,
"char_end": 2238,
"unit_id": "t0014.u01",
"sent_id": "t0014.s02"
},
{
"start": 295.98,
"end": 301.02,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Linear is the ticketing system designed for speed \u2013 it's built for keyboard use.",
"char_start": 2239,
"char_end": 2319,
"unit_id": "t0014.u01",
"sent_id": "t0014.s03"
},
{
"start": 301.08,
"end": 303.72,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Use the link in the episode notes.",
"char_start": 2320,
"char_end": 2354,
"unit_id": "t0014.u01",
"sent_id": "t0014.s04"
},
{
"start": 840.0,
"end": 841.38,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "That's a helpful perspective.",
"char_start": 2355,
"char_end": 2384,
"unit_id": "t0016.u01",
"sent_id": "t0016.s02"
},
{
"start": 841.44,
"end": 845.04,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Where do the fields of human resources and transmission mechanics intersect?",
"char_start": 2385,
"char_end": 2461,
"unit_id": "t0016.u01",
"sent_id": "t0016.s03"
},
{
"start": 845.04,
"end": 846.54,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "This is how I see it.",
"char_start": 2479,
"char_end": 2500,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s01"
},
{
"start": 846.6,
"end": 853.86,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "Most of these mysterious creaking noises can be resolved by cleaning the contact surfaces and tightening the bolts to the specified torque.",
"char_start": 2501,
"char_end": 2640,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s02"
},
{
"start": 853.92,
"end": 856.86,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use Shimano components.",
"char_start": 2641,
"char_end": 2694,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s03"
},
{
"start": 856.92,
"end": 860.52,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "I've observed this pattern repeating itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 2695,
"char_end": 2764,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s04"
},
{
"start": 860.52,
"end": 862.26,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Give me a concrete example.",
"char_start": 2781,
"char_end": 2808,
"unit_id": "t0018.u01",
"sent_id": "t0018.s01"
},
{
"start": 862.32,
"end": 865.74,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "What did you previously believe about this, and what have you revised your views on?",
"char_start": 2809,
"char_end": 2893,
"unit_id": "t0018.u01",
"sent_id": "t0018.s02"
},
{
"start": 865.74,
"end": 872.1,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "Yes, so \u2013 a bike should feel quiet and predictable so that your attention remains focused on the trail.",
"char_start": 2911,
"char_end": 3014,
"unit_id": "t0019.u01",
"sent_id": "t0019.s01"
},
{
"start": 872.16,
"end": 876.84,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "Once you've internalized that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
"char_start": 3015,
"char_end": 3086,
"unit_id": "t0019.u01",
"sent_id": "t0019.s02"
},
{
"start": 876.84,
"end": 877.92,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Let's start with that.",
"char_start": 3103,
"char_end": 3125,
"unit_id": "t0020.u01",
"sent_id": "t0020.s01"
},
{
"start": 877.98,
"end": 881.4,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "What did you previously believe about this, and what have you revised?",
"char_start": 3126,
"char_end": 3196,
"unit_id": "t0020.u01",
"sent_id": "t0020.s02"
},
{
"start": 881.4,
"end": 882.9,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 3214,
"char_end": 3234,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s01"
},
{
"start": 882.96,
"end": 888.96,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "The wear and tear on the chain is the best indicator of when you'll need to replace the cassette.",
"char_start": 3235,
"char_end": 3332,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s02"
},
{
"start": 889.02,
"end": 891.96,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use Shimano components.",
"char_start": 3333,
"char_end": 3386,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s03"
},
{
"start": 892.02,
"end": 896.7,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "Once you understand that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
"char_start": 3387,
"char_end": 3453,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s04"
},
{
"start": 896.7,
"end": 898.2,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "It's settled.\nAlternatively:\nIt's a done deal.\nIt's confirmed.\nIt's arranged.\nIt's agreed.",
"char_start": 3470,
"char_end": 3560,
"unit_id": "t0022.u01",
"sent_id": "t0022.s01"
},
{
"start": 898.2,
"end": 907.98,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "And when teams adopt Spoke & Wrench within this workflow, the trade-offs become apparent. If you ignore these trade-offs, you end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
"char_start": 3578,
"char_end": 3766,
"unit_id": "t0023.u01",
"sent_id": "t0023.s01"
},
{
"start": 907.98,
"end": 909.06,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Let's start with that.",
"char_start": 3783,
"char_end": 3805,
"unit_id": "t0024.u01",
"sent_id": "t0024.s01"
},
{
"start": 909.12,
"end": 913.86,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "What is the operational perspective that most auditors do not have access to?",
"char_start": 3806,
"char_end": 3883,
"unit_id": "t0024.u01",
"sent_id": "t0024.s02"
},
{
"start": 913.86,
"end": 915.36,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 3901,
"char_end": 3921,
"unit_id": "t0025.u01",
"sent_id": "t0025.s01"
},
{
"start": 915.42,
"end": 920.46,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "The maintenance intervals for the suspension are a risk management decision.",
"char_start": 3922,
"char_end": 3998,
"unit_id": "t0025.u01",
"sent_id": "t0025.s02"
},
{
"start": 920.52,
"end": 924.12,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 3999,
"char_end": 4061,
"unit_id": "t0025.u01",
"sent_id": "t0025.s03"
},
{
"start": 1320.0,
"end": 1324.86,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Let's change the subject \u2013 I want to dedicate the final section to risk management.",
"char_start": 4078,
"char_end": 4161,
"unit_id": "t0026.u01",
"sent_id": "t0026.s01"
},
{
"start": 1324.86,
"end": 1333.32,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "That's where the conversation becomes interesting, because the compromises related to risk management touch upon everything we've discussed.",
"char_start": 4179,
"char_end": 4319,
"unit_id": "t0027.u01",
"sent_id": "t0027.s01"
},
{
"start": 1333.32,
"end": 1335.06,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Give me a concrete example.",
"char_start": 4336,
"char_end": 4363,
"unit_id": "t0028.u01",
"sent_id": "t0028.s01"
},
{
"start": 1335.12,
"end": 1339.38,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "What is the most underestimated aspect of transmission mechanics?",
"char_start": 4364,
"char_end": 4429,
"unit_id": "t0028.u01",
"sent_id": "t0028.s02"
},
{
"start": 1339.38,
"end": 1339.92,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "Of course.",
"char_start": 4447,
"char_end": 4457,
"unit_id": "t0029.u01",
"sent_id": "t0029.s01"
},
{
"start": 1339.98,
"end": 1347.24,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "Most mysterious creaking noises can be resolved by cleaning the contact surfaces and tightening the bolts to the specified torque.",
"char_start": 4458,
"char_end": 4588,
"unit_id": "t0029.u01",
"sent_id": "t0029.s02"
},
{
"start": 1347.3,
"end": 1350.66,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use Spoke & Wrench.",
"char_start": 4589,
"char_end": 4638,
"unit_id": "t0029.u01",
"sent_id": "t0029.s03"
},
{
"start": 1350.72,
"end": 1354.32,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "I've seen this pattern repeat in three different teams.",
"char_start": 4639,
"char_end": 4694,
"unit_id": "t0029.u01",
"sent_id": "t0029.s04"
},
{
"start": 1354.32,
"end": 1355.7,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "This is a useful perspective.",
"char_start": 4711,
"char_end": 4740,
"unit_id": "t0030.u01",
"sent_id": "t0030.s01"
},
{
"start": 1355.76,
"end": 1360.74,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "What is the contrarian viewpoint that most listeners don't have access to?",
"char_start": 4741,
"char_end": 4815,
"unit_id": "t0030.u01",
"sent_id": "t0030.s02"
},
{
"start": 1360.74,
"end": 1367.64,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "It all boils down to this: a bike should feel quiet and predictable so that your attention remains focused on the trail.",
"char_start": 4833,
"char_end": 4953,
"unit_id": "t0031.u01",
"sent_id": "t0031.s01"
},
{
"start": 1367.7,
"end": 1371.36,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "The geometry matters because it tells you what compromises you're making.",
"char_start": 4954,
"char_end": 5027,
"unit_id": "t0031.u01",
"sent_id": "t0031.s02"
},
{
"start": 1371.36,
"end": 1373.82,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "What does the failure mode look like?",
"char_start": 5044,
"char_end": 5081,
"unit_id": "t0032.u01",
"sent_id": "t0032.s01"
},
{
"start": 1373.88,
"end": 1378.14,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "What is the most underestimated aspect of transmission mechanics?",
"char_start": 5082,
"char_end": 5147,
"unit_id": "t0032.u01",
"sent_id": "t0032.s02"
},
{
"start": 1378.14,
"end": 1384.92,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "Honestly, the wear on the chain is the best early indicator of when you'll need to replace the cassette.",
